668.description:
Kickstarter is a great platform for budding studios looking to create their own game. With a good idea and enthusiasm, a development studio can post their game concept on the platform. This is precisely what Johannesburg-based The Brotherhood did, submitting their horror quest idea for review and approval. StasisThe game earned acclaim, and the necessary funds were raised. A little less than two years have passed since then, and now, August 31st — the game's release date.

Features:
- The game is paid, you can buy it on Steam and GOG, Valve even provided an entire page with a description of the new product, the only thing is that there is no pre-order option, but this will not last long.
- Regarding localization – regarding translation for the Russian-speaking population – the interface + subtitles will be in Russian;
- Plot. A waaaay distant future, a wrecked ship, the Groomlake, is floating in orbit around Neptune. John Marachek, our protagonist, awakens from cryosleep to discover that the rest of the crew is either dead or has vanished without a trace. How he managed to survive the disaster remains a mystery.
- Gameplay. The destroyed ship can't fly, as almost all systems are damaged, so another catastrophe, only this time final, can be expected in the near future. John will have to sort out all this chaos and find his daughter and wife;
- It'll be fun! And scary. Riddles and puzzles, a quest and logic game, you'll need to find answers and a way out of the situation;
- Among the interesting features, it is worth noting that the game does not have a side or first-person view; the creators chose an isometric view.

3270.description:
Bee Simulator – an unusual simulator that invites players to take on the role of an ordinary bee and experience the insect's entire life cycle. It sounds unusual, but thanks to this unusual theme, you'll have an unforgettable experience. After all, no other game has ever offered you control of a bee, which must not only explore its surroundings but also strive to improve its hive. And what about the other insects, who are hostile? Yes, achieving success can be difficult at times, but we believe you can do it. All that's left to do is download the torrent. Bee Simulator and you can set off on an unforgettable adventure.

Game features
- an excellent opportunity to see the world from the perspective of a little bee;
- the vast territory of Central Park is available for thorough exploration;
- several game modes, each of which has a different fundamental goal;
- you have to fight for your family and try to do everything for its development;
- it is possible to play with friends on one computer;
- there is an opportunity to interact with the environment;
- download option Bee Simulator will always be available for use via torrent in Russian;
- no violence, only peaceful life of insects;
- pleasant music, beautiful surroundings and a favorable atmosphere, all this will now belong to you.

